@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' purpose: reusable chess UI primitives — one component per interaction, so journey, difficulty, and analytics do not restyle a board three times
' status: proposed 2026-09-17, not implemented; _spec/_plans/ is exempt from the SPEC-reference rule.
' would touch: not in this tree — no chess board, picker, or HUD primitives exist
'   under the sandbox checkout (measured 2026-09-17). Locate the owning UI
'   package before a covers: line can be honest.
'   the journey that consumes them ...... _spec/_plans/chess-user-journey.puml
'   difficulty control ................. _spec/_plans/chess-save-difficulty.puml
'   analytics widgets .................. _spec/_plans/chess-analytics.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
'
' ── WHAT THE LINE ITEM SETTLES ─────────────────────────────────────────────
' "reusable UI primitives" is a FOUNDATION slice. Buttons, the board chrome,
' a picker, a dialog, a toast — named once, used by the other chess plans.
' Restyling each screen in place is how the journey forks.
'
' ── WHAT IT DOES NOT SETTLE ────────────────────────────────────────────────
'   the kit (web, native, existing design system)
'   which widgets are in v1
'   accessibility beyond "must be used by the journey"
'
' This file lands first among the chess plans. Journey, difficulty, and
' analytics that ship ahead of it will invent a second kit.
title PLANNED — one primitive kit for chess UI;\njourney and analytics do not restyle the board

component "primitive kit" as KIT <<app>>
component "board chrome · picker\ndialog · toast · list row" as W <<app>>
component "user journey screens" as JOURNEY <<app>>
component "difficulty control" as DIFF <<app>>
component "analytics widgets" as AN <<app>>
component "**a third restyle**\nof the same control" as FORK <<error>>

KIT ARROW_MAIN W
W ARROW_MAIN JOURNEY
W ARROW_MAIN DIFF
W ARROW_MAIN AN
JOURNEY ARROW_ERROR FORK : if it draws its own
DIFF ARROW_ERROR FORK
AN ARROW_ERROR FORK

note bottom of KIT
  **Primitives are the contract: a picker
  difficulty cannot reuse is not primitive yet.**
  Extract after two call sites rather than after
  one decorative mock.
end note

note bottom of FORK
  **Three visual treatments of the same control is
  the failure this kit exists to prevent.** If
  analytics invents a table the journey cannot
  host, the shared primitive set did not land.
end note

note right of W
  **The first shared set is board chrome, a gated
  picker, a confirm dialog, and a toast.** Charts
  wait on the analytics plan rather than expanding
  this kit prematurely.
end note

legend bottom
  **The order to do it in**
  ==
  **1. Inventory the live screens.** List every chess control that already
  exists. Deduplicate names. That list is the kit, not a redesign.
  --
  **2. Extract the shared set.** Board chrome, picker, dialog, toast, list
  row. Each has one props contract. Difficulty and analytics may not add a
  look; they may add a prop.
  ==
  **3. Ban screen-local restyles.** Journey work that needs a new widget
  extends the kit in this file's spirit, or it is a fork.
  --
  **Left open**: visual language; whether proveo choiceui is a reference or
  unrelated; mobile density.
end legend
@enduml
